#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""OpenSPP Training Template Developer CLI.

A unified interface for working on dswd_* modules against a local OpenSPP:
  - pull: Download the published Docker image (fast path)
  - build: Build the Docker image locally
  - vendor: Download the read-only OpenSPP source for reading and searching
  - start: Start Odoo + OpenSPP in Docker
  - stop: Stop all services
  - test: Run module tests (isolated, won't affect running dev instance)
  - resetdb: Reset database with optional demo data
  - logs: View container logs
  - shell: Open Odoo shell or psql
  - url: Get/open the dev server URL
  - lint: Run linters on changed files
  - doctor: Check prerequisites and environment

The OpenSPP release is pinned once, in .env (OPENSPP_REF).
Works in both Docker mode (local dev) and local mode (Claude Code web).
"""

